{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的纵向话语与感受交替，扫读路径不如Y左侧叙述、右侧短词的固定布局直观；不过分时出现的感受缓解了同时阅读的压力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的【】突出每段真正的心理转折，叙述也更清楚地交代了人物为什么在怀念、委屈、不甘和孤独之间反复摇摆，尤其是从想念被接纳到决定不再为此忍受委屈，前后因果比较完整。它的音乐感受不仅有情绪标签，还有节奏、音色、动作和情绪变化之间的具体对应，而且分时出现能让观众边听边感受到细微变化；Y的固定左右布局更容易扫读，但部分感受被压缩成概括性短词，人物心理与音乐细节之间的对应也相对粗略。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fbe340a1-2c41-483e-9c1b-ff574365a22f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010521194515Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:06:29.859013+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0ce1c9b9787ec331d90b00c88e436d24e045e08d7036814548488383634e3a72", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat